>板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"55.4\" width=\"320\" height=\"11.800000000000004\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,82.5 9.1,82.7 14.2,82.9 19.3,76.3 24.5,85.6 29.6,76.3 34.7,77.3 39.8,78.3 44.9,73.3 50.0,71.3 55.1,81.2 60.3,59.3 65.4,60.8 70.5,54.5 75.6,48.0 80.7,49.3 85.8,55.2 91.0,53.6 96.1,50.6 101.2,40.3 106.3,45.4 111.4,63.1 116.5,51.1 121.6,39.2 126.8,45.6 131.9,35.4 137.0,12.8 142.1,56.0 147.2,60.7 152.3,72.8 157.4,79.9 162.6,89.9 167.7,77.9 172.8,70.4 177.9,74.3 183.0,69.7 188.1,77.5 193.2,73.7 198.4,72.4 203.5,95.6 208.6,97.2 213.7,78.9 218.8,89.1 223.9,94.1 229.0,82.5 234.2,68.5 239.3,61.5 244.4,46.5 249.5,44.1 254.6,46.8 259.7,41.5 264.9,31.3 270.0,34.4 275.1,45.6 280.2,45.4 285.3,52.6 290.4,45.2 295.5,28.5 300.7,44.6 305.8,54.5 310.9,52.2 316.0,50.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 91.0 65.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 111.4 75.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 270.0 46.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"50.9\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; 